1
00:00:00,261 --> 00:00:03,031
(Bernadette:)Well, we didn't exactly decide.

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:04,300
(Bernadette:)We were talking about it,

3
00:00:04,298 --> 00:00:06,528
(Bernadette:)and then one night
we got a little reckless.

4
00:00:06,534 --> 00:00:08,534
Oh, tell us!
Yeah, tell us.

5
00:00:08,536 --> 00:00:09,766
(Bernadette:)No, I'm embarrassed.
Oh, come on,

6
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,540
(Penny:)we're all grown-ups.
We've all done it.

7
00:00:11,539 --> 00:00:14,569
Me! Me-me, too!
I'm a grown-up and I've done it!

8
00:00:16,977 --> 00:00:18,977
(Leonard:)Fine.

9
00:00:18,979 --> 00:00:20,509
(Bernadette:)We were out one night,

10
00:00:20,514 --> 00:00:24,084
(Bernadette:)and things got
a little spontaneous.

11
00:00:24,085 --> 00:00:26,015
(Amy:)Oh, that sounds juicy.

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,950
(Bernadette:)Well, Sheldon was going on
and on about time zones

13
00:00:27,955 --> 00:00:30,805
(Bernadette:)and railroad schedules,
and I went out...

14
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:33,190
(Penny:)Wait, I remember that.
Hang on.

15
00:00:33,194 --> 00:00:36,834
(Penny:)You did it
at our place?

16
00:00:36,831 --> 00:00:40,031
(Bernadette:)Kind of on Sheldon's bed.

17
00:00:40,034 --> 00:00:42,634
What?!
No!

18
00:00:43,471 --> 00:00:45,441
(Bernadette:)I was headed to the bathroom,

19
00:00:45,439 --> 00:00:47,769
(Bernadette:)and I passed Howie
on his way out.

20
00:00:47,775 --> 00:00:51,645
(Bernadette:)Usually he says,
"Do not go in there,"

21
00:00:51,645 --> 00:00:56,585
(Bernadette:)but this time he said,
"Hey, let's go in here."

22
00:00:56,584 --> 00:00:58,114
(Amy:)How could you do that?
I'm sorry,

23
00:00:58,119 --> 00:01:00,349
(Bernadette:)but you know what it's like
when you're with your man

